c53::a https://github.com/JarleB/oxide-openshift/blob/main/cluster.yaml ::c
c54::a https://oxide.computer ::c
e55::a "source the functions file, run fetch_master_backends and combine the output with the haproxy_config stub and apply the config to the loadbalancer." ::e
c56::a user_data ::c

